{"version":1,"content":"<p>佳寶即日至11月15日八折，全線分店同步進行。</p><p>指定汽水（330毫升）八罐裝折後價$24.8。</p><p>指定啤酒（330毫升）折後價六罐$9.6。</p><p>刀嘜芥花籽油（1000毫升）折後價三支$68。</p><p>指定北海道帶子折後價一盒$208。</p><p>數量有限，售完即止。</p><p>［詳情］（資料以店方最新公布為準）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T04:23:04.769497+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T03:38:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T04:18:38.663136+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T04:18:38.663136+00:00","content_hash":"9b0d7cf296ae1fb4ceca0cd1ba7bff11c8d785e19d89409ce973e53f88bb0638","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}